    "ssky_text_block_G7NC6W": {
      "type": "ssky-text-block",
      "blocks": {
        "caption_9AJPXf": {
          "type": "caption",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "Inspiring Nonfiction for Children to Immerse Themselves In",
            "custom_color": "",
            "text_style": "large-bold",
            "color_class": "primary-blue"
          }
        },
        "text_hFkmwQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>Our nonfiction children’s books help young readers understand the world while developing critical thinking and confidence. Your children can enjoy our engaging stories filled with colorful illustrations and age-appropriate lessons that make learning exciting and meaningful.</p><h2>Benefits of Nonfiction Books for Kids</h2><p>Our nonfiction for kids collection is designed to help parents raise thoughtful, independent thinkers. Here are some of the biggest benefits of reading our kids nonfiction books.</p><h3>Builds Real-World Knowledge</h3><p>Our kids nonfiction titles introduce essential concepts, like <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/collections/economics-for-kids\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Economics</span></a> and <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/collections/american-history-for-kids\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">American history</span></a>, in a way children easily understand. Our nonfiction children’s books explain complex topics with simple language and relatable stories, preparing young minds for the challenges of adulthood. Your kids can enjoy learning real-world concepts that aren’t taught in schools in a relatable, age-appropriate way..</p><h3>Encourages Critical Thinking</h3><p>Our children’s nonfiction books encourage your kids to ask questions, analyze ideas, form their own opinions, and actively discuss their thoughts. Each one of our books includes discussion prompts and activities, helping families explore the lessons together and strengthen problem-solving skills.</p><h3>Makes Learning Fun and Memorable</h3><p>We combine exciting adventures and memorable characters to keep young readers engaged. By using fun storytelling with accurate information, our nonfiction books for children ensure knowledge sticks long after the last page is turned.</p><h3>Strengthens Family Conversations</h3><p>Our nonfiction children’s books are designed to be read together. Parents and kids can talk about things like freedom, entrepreneurship (check out<a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-twins-and-the-messed-up-market\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Messed Up Market</span></a>), businesses, and personal responsibility while enjoying meaningful, value-based discussions that build stronger family connections.</p><h3>Promotes Lifelong Curiosity</h3><p>With every book, we encourage children to think beyond the classroom. Our nonfiction for kids collection inspires curiosity about various topics, like <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-twins-and-their-spectacular-show-business\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Show Business</span></a> or law (check out <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-twins-and-the-food-truck-fiasco\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">The Tuttle Twins and the Food Truck Fiasco</span></a>), giving them the confidence to keep exploring and asking “why.”</p>",
            "text_size": "regular",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "caption_9AJPXf",
        "text_hFkmwQ"
      ],
