          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Do We Have Books for Younger and Older Children?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>We have so many books to keep your children entertained and engaged, no matter what stage of life they’re in. We have hardy <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/collections/toddler-books\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">toddler books</span></a> that are perfect for little hands to chew and throw around without a worry. Our <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/collections/books-for-teens\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">books for teens</span></a> help older children develop independent mindsets and opinions of their own.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_cACq98": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Do These Books Align With Specific School Subjects?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! Our kids nonfiction collection complements subjects like history, civics, law, and economics, reinforcing what children learn in school while making big ideas exciting and easy to understand.</p>",
